OL,4,AFMQs
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Swinney faces questions from
OL,7,Fopposition party leaders for the first
OL,8,Ftime since the October recess
OL,10,FMichael Marra, the Scottish Labour
OL,11,Fleader, hails the UK Budget and urges
OL,12,Fthe FM to come up with a plan to
OL,13,Fdeliver growth in Scotland
OL,15,FSwinney voices his worry that
OL,16,FChancellor of the Exchequer John
OL,17,FHealey's first budget has left Scotland
OL,18,Fwith #550m less in funding
